    cml:logicSummary "Modern award takes effect on first full pay period after operation day" ;
    cml:premiseText "(6) A modern award, or a determination revoking a modern award, does not take effect in relation to a particular employee until the Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Core provisions for this Chapter  Division 2 Section 50 Fair Work Act 2009" ;
