    cml:operator "Overlaps" ;
    cml:logicSummary "Enterprise agreements terminate at the time of operation cessation." ;
    cml:premiseText "(5) Despite subsections (1), (2) and (3), an enterprise agreement that has ceased to operate does not cover an employee, employer or employee organisation." ;
    cml:conclusionText "The operation cessation of an enterprise agreement overlaps with its termination." ;
    cml:executionSurface "modalities::interval_reasoning" ;
